{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1305846-thin-blood-merits-advantages-questions","id":1305846,"title":"Thin-Blood Merits/Advantages Questions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-04-18T16:56:10-07:00","id":1305846,"title":"Thin-Blood Merits/Advantages Questions","content":"1) Can thin-blood merits other than TBA be purchased with exp like other merits?<br /> 2) Most people say TBA can be bought with exp after CC, what would be the cost for this?<br /> 3) Can thin-blood ghoul people like normal with catenating blood? Why or Why not?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6922-houston810","name":"Houston810","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6922_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"64"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-18T21:48:10-07:00","id":1305902,"title":"","content":"1) Nothing says they can, but ask your Storyteller. It would make perfect sense to gain something like <i>Camarilla Contact</i> in play, and even <i>Day Drinker</i> could plausibly be the result of a bizarre alchemy experiment.<br /> <br /> 2) The merit gets you one dot of Alchemy. But you can also buy Alchemy just like a normal in-clan Discipline\u2014in fact, the only Discipline thinbloods can buy without the <i>Discipline Affinity</i> merit\u2014whether or not you took the merit.<br /> <br /> 3) I would assume no, they can't. The <i>Catenating Blood</i> merit says specifically that you can make blood bonds and Embrace, it doesn't say anything about making ghouls.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24808-draconis","name":"Draconis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24808_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"805"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-19T04:14:01-07:00","id":1305962,"title":"","content":"Note: I don't have the book in front of me for refence so everything is just from memory right now.<br /> <br /> 1) I do not belive you can, as thin blood merits are unique kind of merits. They do not count to your starting dots in merits they do not have a dot (cost) associated with them, and you are required to take a thin blood flaw for each one.<br /> <br /> 2) As said above, you can buy it without the merit. To thin bloods it is in clan so its that cost (5 x New Dot).<br /> <br /> 3) I'm 95% sure thin bloods can make ghouls they just only last one night...though i could be thinking a merit or something. Again no book in front of me.<br /> <br /> Hope this helps.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24831-doommango","name":"Doommango","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24831_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-19T10:03:45-07:00","id":1306032,"title":"","content":"1. You can't. They don't have a dot rating to purchase; they are something for Thin Blood character creation (and must be balanced, one flaw per one merit).<br /> 2. I believe TBA is considered 'in clan' for Thin Bloods, since it's only available to them and would cost the 'in clan' cost of New x 5 then formulae at level x 3.<br /> 3. Thin Bloods make ghouls that last only one night. Pg 111 under Blood.","signature":"","edited":{"user